    (property "Note" "At left_thumb's QH on the main board, before HOP_LT_RH leaves for the right_hand ribbon (owner, 2026-10-01; pre-layout review A5-2): its RC with the ribbon delays the hop's data past right_hand's clock, so the hop holds with no CLK-to-QH delay at all (key-chain-loom.md, The hop hold time; key-chain-loom/sim hop-hold-lt-to-rh)" (at 215.9 205.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))
